# Client markers: one regex per line (case-insensitive). Lines starting with # are ignored.
# A commit to a PUBLIC repo is blocked if any added line matches one of these.
# Copy to ~/.claude/hooks/client-markers.txt and replace the examples with real values.

# Client and org names (word boundaries stop "acme" matching inside other words)
(?<![a-z0-9])acme(?![a-z0-9])
acme-corp
# Cluster and domain names
prod-cluster-01
\.acme\.internal
# Real client subnets (sample IPs elsewhere are fine)
(?<![0-9])10\.42\.[0-9]
